gallery-node-0 = Semantic colors supply surfaces, text, borders and feedback for every component.
gallery-node-1 = Typography selects a real font face, weight and size for each role, on both platforms.
gallery-node-2 = Metrics supply spacing, control heights, corner radii and responsive breakpoints.
gallery-node-3 = Button displays an action and returns its activation. Its role chooses the shared styling.
gallery-node-4 = ValueField composes an input with icon actions. It owns clipping, reveal and responsive action placement; the host acknowledges clipboard success or failure.
gallery-node-5 = Icons are vector drawings with shared size and stroke; their meaning has an accessible label.
gallery-node-6 = FieldCard owns a frame, editable name, type label, drag handle and removal. The supplied body renders the value.
gallery-node-7 = Card provides one shared surface, border, padding and radius around supplied content.
gallery-node-8 = Grid and Panel allocate bounded slots, scrolling content and pinned actions. They do not own application data.
gallery-node-9 = RecordEditor composes a header, tags and reorderable FieldCards with pinned actions. The application owns values and applies moves.
